---
import '../styles/rules.scss'
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'

---
<Layout title="Rules">
    <article class="items">
        <section class="item">
            <img src="/imgs/gameplay.jpg" alt="Gameplay" class="img">
            <h2>Gameplay</h2>
            <p><strong>Winning</strong>: The last player alive wins the game. Try to vanquish your opponent! OR First to land on their opponents starting tiles wins the game.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>You have two actions per turn (Explore tiles or move to gain an advantage)
                    <ul>
                        <li>Players can take damage from unlucky exploration or being attacked.</li>
                        <li>Each player has two lives</li>
                    </ul>
            </li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
            <img src="/imgs/movement.jpg" alt="Movement" class="img">
            <h2>Movement</h2>
            <p>Players can only move to directly adjacent tiles.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>You <strong>cannot</strong> move diagonally between tiles.</li>
                <li>You <strong>cannot</strong> move to a tile that another player is on</li>
                <li>You cannot move out of bounds.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
            <img src="/imgs/actions.jpg" alt="Actions" class="img">
            <h2>Actions</h2>
            <p>Each player gets <strong>2 actions per turn</strong> on the side of the river you start on, and <strong>3 actions</strong> on the opposite side.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>An action can be used to<ul>
                <li><strong>Move (1x)</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Arrows (2x): 1 Gold</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Raft (1x): 2 Gold</strong></li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
            <img src="/imgs/setup.jpg" alt="Setup" class="img">
            <h2>Setup</h2>
            <p>Each player begins on a <strong>start tile</strong> on <strong>opposite ends</strong> of the board. Roll the dice to decide who <strong>moves</strong> first.<br>Each player starts with:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Lives x2</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Food x4</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Health x5</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Sword lvl.1</strong></li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
            <img src="/imgs/food.jpg" alt="Food" class="img">
            <h2>Food</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>You consume one food at the <strong>start</strong> of each turn.</li>
                <li>If you have no food to consume, you lose 2 health.</li>
                <li>You can hold a maximum of 8 pieces of food</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Death</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>If you die, respawn on a start tile with the starting inventory (See “Setup”)</li>
            </ul>
            <h2>Exploration</h2>
            <p>If you decide to explore, roll the dice. The outcomes differ between tile types</p>
            <p>You <strong>cannot</strong> explore the same tile two turns in a row</p>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
            <div class="imgs">
                <img src="/imgs/forest.jpg" alt="Forest Tile" class="img">
                <img src="/imgs/mine.jpg" alt="Mine Tile" class="img">
                <img src="/imgs/mountain.jpg" alt="Mountain Tile" class="img">
                <img src="/imgs/river.jpg" alt="River Tile" class="img">
                <img src="/imgs/temple.jpg" alt="Temple Tile" class="img">
                <img src="/imgs/village.jpg" alt="Village Tile" class="img">
            </div>
            <h2>Tiles</h2>
            <h4>---  Forest Tiles (Food)</h4>
            <p>Landing Bonus: <strong>+2 food</strong><br>Terrain Bonus: <strong>None</strong></p>
            <p><strong>Explore</strong>: (Roll a die)</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Get robbed (See “Robber”)</li>
                <li>-1 health</li>
                <li>Your next turn you cannot explore or move.</li>
                <li>+1 bow</li>
                <li>+2 arrows</li>
                <li>+1 food</li>
            </ol>
            <h4>---  Mine Tile (Gold)</h4>
            <p>Landing Bonus: <strong>+1 gold</strong><br>Terrain Bonus: <strong>None</strong></p>
            <p><strong>Explore</strong>: (Roll a die)</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Get robbed (See “Robber”)</li>
                <li>-1 health</li>
                <li>+1 health</li>
                <li>+1 gold</li>
                <li>+1 upgraded Sword Lvl.</li>
                <li>+1 food</li>
            </ol>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
            <h2>Tiles (contd.)</h2>    
            <h4>---  Mountain Tiles (Bows)</h4>
            <p>Landing Bonus: <strong>+1 arrow</strong><br>Terrain Bonus: <strong>Increased bow range (See “Combat”)</strong></p>
            <p><strong>Explore</strong>: (Roll a die)</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Get Robbed</li>
                <li>-1 health </li>
                <li>+2 arrow</li>
                <li>+1 Bow</li>
                <li>+1 upgraded sword lvl.</li>
                <li>+1 food</li>
            </ol>
            <h4>---  Temple Tiles (Chance)</h4>
            <p>Landing Bonus: <strong>None</strong><br>Terrain Bonus: <strong>None</strong></p>
            <p><strong>Explore</strong>: (Roll a die)</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Get Robbed <strong>AND</strong> -1 sword lvl (If possible, If losing a sword level is not possible get robbed again)</li>
                <li>-2 health</li>
                <li>Go back two tiles of your choosing  (You do <strong>NOT</strong> receive the landing bonus from the tile you land on) <strong>AND</strong> end your turn with 1 food (even if you had 0)</li>
                <li>+2 gold <strong>AND</strong> Take 1 item from your opponent (food, gold, arrow)</li>
                <li>+1 upgraded sword lvl <strong>AND</strong> +1 health</li>
                <li>+5 food <strong>OR</strong> (+1 bow <strong>AND</strong> +1 arrow <strong>AND</strong> +1 food) (You Choose)</li>
            </ol>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
            <h2>Tiles (contd.)</h2>
            <h4>---  River Tiles (Trap)</h4>
            <p>Landing Bonus: <strong>+1 food</strong><br>Terrain Bonus: You <strong>cannot</strong> move the turn after you land.<br>Raft: A raft allows you to move across in 1 turn</p>
            <p>River tiles count as your side meaning you only have two actions on a river<br>After you move off of the river tile discard your raft.</p>
            <p><strong>Explore</strong>: (Roll a die)</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Get Robbed</li>
                <li>+1 food</li>
                <li>+1 food</li>
                <li>+1 food</li>
                <li>+2 food</li>
                <li>+2 food</li>
            </ol>
            <h4>---Villages Tiles (Trade)</h4>
            <p>Landing Bonus: <strong>None</strong><br>Terrain Bonus: <strong>You can buy items using gold.</strong> </p>
            <p>Each trade costs one action: Ex. You just moved onto a village on your side, so you can trade with the village once. </p>
            <p><strong>Trade</strong>:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Food (2x): 1 Gold</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Sword (Lvl. 2): 1 Gold + Sword Lvl. 1</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Sword (Lvl. 3): 2 Gold + Sword Lvl. 2</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Bow (1x): 2 Gold</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Arrows (2x): 1 Gold</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Raft (1x): 2 Gold</strong></li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
            <img src="/imgs/combat.jpg" alt="Combat" class="img">
            <h2>Combat</h2>
            <p>You can attack your opponent. Attacking costs an action.</p>
            <p>You can use an action regenerate health <strong>(Max health is 5)</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>-2 food for +1 health</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Lvl. 1 sword:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>-1 health to the opponent</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Lvl. 2 sword:</strong><br>Roll a die to determine damage</p>
            <ul>
                <li>1/2/3: -1 health to the opponent</li>
                <li>4/5/6: -2 health to the opponent</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Lvl. 3 sword:</strong><br>Roll a die to determine damage</p>
            <ul>
                <li>1/2/3: -2 health to the opponent</li>
                <li>4/5/6: -3 health to the opponent</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>Bow:</strong><br>-1 arrow every time you attack</p>
            <ul>
                <li>-1 health to the opponent</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="item">
            <img src="/imgs/robber.jpg" alt="Robber" class="img">
            <h2>Robber</h2>
            <p>The robber will take 1 gold from you (-1 gold)</p>
            <p>If you do not have gold, the robber will take 1 food (-1 food)</p>
        </section>
    </article>
</Layout>